### 6. Server Actions

- [**`lib/actions/admin.ts`**](file:///c:/Users/LOQ/OneDrive/Desktop/FixSL/web/lib/actions/admin.ts): All admin server actions:
  - `requireAdmin()` — Clerk auth helper that checks `sessionClaims.metadata.role === "admin"`, throws `ForbiddenError` otherwise
  - `getAdminStats()` — Aggregates status/priority counts from all issues
  - `getAdminIssues(filters?)` — Fetches issues with optional status/category/priority filtering
  - `getAdminIssueById(id)` — Single issue by UUID
  - `updateIssueStatus(issueId, status)` — Clerk auth + Zod validation + DB update + logger
  - `updateIssuePriority(issueId, priority)` — Clerk auth + Zod validation + DB update + logger
  - All actions wrapped in `safeAction()` with structured logging

